tion 4.4.2-4.4.4, Section 4.4.10) | `NodeDetailDrawer.tsx` hardcodes static URLs for `Bill` (always H.R. 3630), `PublicLaw` (always 117-328), `Regulation` (hardcoded date string), and `LobbyingFiling` (generic search homepage). | Selecting H.R. 2617 or H.R. 3808 displays an incorrect link pointing to H.R. 3630. Selecting lobbying filing `c8697fc5-...` links to generic search instead of specific disclosure document. |\n| **DEF-09** | Frontend Verification and Test Suite Coverage (`functional_specification_006.md` Section 5 Acceptance Criteria 1-4) | Current automated test suites test backend logic and REST endpoints only. Zero automated component tests verify frontend toolbar cleanliness, HUD accordion toggle, stationary hover stability, or link generation logic. | Acceptance criteria cannot be programmatically validated without dedicated frontend component and link audit tests. |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Sufficiency \u0026 Scan Certification\n\nIn strict accordance with the evaluation parameters in [`LANGUAGE.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-1-20261013T165618-008-wcap/LANGUAGE.md):\n\n- **`{sufficient}` Certification:** The static scan of the codebase and active read-only reconnaissance of external datasources are complete, exhaustive, and rigorously verified. Every qualified codebase component touching `functional_specification_006.md` has been cataloged under its verbatim symbol and file path. Every candidate external endpoint (CMS MCD, GPO GovInfo, Congress.gov, Federal Register, Cornell LII, CMS Transmittals, CGS Administrators, Noridian Healthcare Solutions, CDC ICD-10-CM, NLM Clinical Tables, and Senate SOPR LDA) has been actively probed and empirically audited, with 23 raw unedited payload and probe files captured in `assets/20261013T165618-008-wcap/`. Zero ambiguity remains regarding the existing dependency cone, external contracts, or observed system behaviors.\n- **Zero Invention Guarantee:** In accordance with `INV-ABSENC